WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.400
What? You want us to attend your party?

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.030
I'm inviting everyone from town to express

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:10.860
my appreciation for all they do for me.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.390
Us, too?

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:14.440
Of course.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.070
Hooray!

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.070
Woof!

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:16.980
I'm so excited!

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.670
A party, huh?

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.020
<i>That's right. Even in my own world...</i>

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.250
<b>Kuro
Tami</b>

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:23.750
Yes, got it.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:29.050
You'd like five types of sashimi, and 
you'd like three highballs, right? Got it.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:30.460
Waiter!

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.860
Hey, Kirio.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.420
Here you are.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:37.360
That's the thing about you, Kirio...

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.920
<i>Those were seriously painful times.</i>

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.730
Mr. Reiji.

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:47.060
Huh?

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.010
Let's attend the party.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:50.400
Come with us, Master.

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:53.860
You could use it as an opportunity 
to promote your store.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:56.550
You'll come, won't you?

00:00:56.550 --> 00:00:57.120
Huh?

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.100
You'll go, won't you?

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.870
Yeah, yeah. Fine.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.030
I'll go. That's what you want, right?

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:07.500
All right!

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.270
<b>Drugstore</b>

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.270
<b>In Another World</b>

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:43.860
Mr. Reiji, Mr. Reiji!

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:44.470
Yeah?

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:47.230
What shall we wear to the party?

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:50.500
Can't we wear what we always wear?

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:55.750
But it's a party. Let's get dressed up for it.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:56.830
Right, Ms. Noela?

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:59.270
Woof. I'm going to dress up.

00:02:59.270 --> 00:03:01.100
Just you two, then.

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:04.490
Aw, come on. Let's all 
get dressed up together.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:06.230
You, too, Master.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:09.420
Dressed up? What am 
I supposed to wear, anyway?

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.670
Master!

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:11.040
Huh?

00:03:11.450 --> 00:03:13.580
Allow me to handle that!

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.350
Handle what, exactly?

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:19.060
I overheard your entire conversation.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:21.050
You were eavesdropping?

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.320
By wearing an outfit put 
together by Garo Ejil,

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.930
the man who will someday rule the world,

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:34.130
even the lowest class of person 
can become king of the party.

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:36.140
You just casually called 
me low-class, didn't you?

00:03:36.140 --> 00:03:39.030
Master won't wear your clothes.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.250
What? Ms. Noela, why would you say that?

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:45.950
I believe only the Demon King should 
wear the Demon King's clothes.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:49.270
Then at least allow me to 
accompany you to this party

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:52.570
and instruct you in the 
manners of high society.

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:56.820
I've actually received an invitation 
from Ms. Elaine myself.

00:03:56.820 --> 00:03:58.050
You wanna come, too?

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.000
Very well.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.240
You, too?

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.180
I am a well-mannered Demon King.

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:04.720
Our positions are reversed.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.300
This time, I shall be your master.

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:08.720
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:14.100
Master, am I being rewarded?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.430
He's in the way.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.780
Let's get him out of here.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:20.460
At least it's quiet now.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:21.780
Welcome...

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:22.970
Medicine God!

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:23.840
Please!

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.800
Please help us!

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:26.910
Eh? Huh?!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.630
What? The Red Cat Brigade, too?

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:35.930
Yes. Captain Annabelle received an 
invitation from Count Valgas yesterday.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:38.900
He invited the entire brigade.

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:43.890
Vice Captain Doz and I will be goin' with her.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:47.550
I see. But why do you need my help?

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.030
That's the thing, Medicine God.

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:53.380
Doz isn't great with drinkin' parties.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:05:01.450
Oh, I can relate. I've also been invited, 
but I've never liked large drinking parties.

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:03.440
Uh, that's not the problem.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:03.780
Huh?

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:07.000
It's the alcohol that Doz can't handle.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:07.740
Yeah.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:08.870
Oh, so that's it.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.470
Last time we had a drinkin' party,

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:14.200
I didn't remember nothin' that 
happened after just a few drinks.

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.300
When I woke up in the mornin', 
I was inside a barrel.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:18.130
Huh?

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:21.590
The captain laughed at me about it.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:23.500
So, uh...

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:29.790
Basically, we want ya to help Doz 
man up in front of the captain.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:31.060
Er, uh...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.950
In other words, Mr. Doz, 
who can't handle his liquor,

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:36.640
wants to show off for 
Ms. Annabelle at the party.

00:05:36.870 --> 00:05:40.710
Well, uh... yes, that's right.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:42.400
I get that.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.990
I mean, Ms. Annabelle does have a gallant 
personality, and she's certainly pretty.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.700
Sparkle! Sparkle! Sparkle!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:49.900
Yeah...

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:51.050
Medicine God!

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:51.910
Yes?

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:56.280
Could you increase Doz's 
tolerance for just one day?

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:57.520
Medicine God,

00:05:57.520 --> 00:06:03.050
I want to escort the captain back to the 
barracks after the party like a gentleman!

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:05.970
Okay, okay. I'll come up with 
something. Personal space...

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:08.860
Thank you, Medicine God!

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.870
Please raise your heads.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.120
Also, I've told you countless times already,

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:16.050
but I'm a pharmacist, not a medicine god.

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:18.940
Now, then...

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.840
Mr. Reiji, what are you making now?

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:24.780
A medicine to keep 
Mr. Doz from getting drunk.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:25.360
Woof?

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:28.110
By the way, what happened to Ejil?

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.530
Is he okay?

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:33.330
Yes. He seems to be happily 
talking in his sleep.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.370
Fluffy...

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.540
What in the world is he dreaming about?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:39.540
Master, I'll help.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.470
I'll help, too.

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:42.960
All right, let's do this.

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.480
It's done.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:12.240
<b>Liver Buddy EX</b>

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:08.980
<i>Liver Buddy EX. Improves liver function.</i>

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:12.240
<i>Prevents alcohol-related 
sickness and hangovers.</i>

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:15.390
Noela, could you take this to Mr. Doz?

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:19.360
Oh, right. Make sure 
Ms. Annabelle doesn't notice.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:20.830
Woof, got it.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.000
Woof!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.830
See you later.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.880
I'm counting on you.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:30.460
Now Mr. Doz should be able to 
show off for Ms. Annabelle.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:31.290
Yeah.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:37.210
Anyway, a party, huh? What a hassle.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:39.460
I'm really excited for it.

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:40.840
Are you?

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:46.400
I was all alone in this 
house until you arrived.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.190
But things are different now.

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:53.140
I can go anywhere with you and Ms. Noela.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:55.910
It makes me so happy.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:58.620
It's like we're a family.

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:00.410
Mina...

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:05.070
In that case, let's all get 
dressed up and attend this party.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:06.410
Okay!

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:09.820
Hup.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:12.280
There are plenty more 
clothes in the basement.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:14.830
I've got clothes for you and Ms. Noela, too.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.760
Look. This is my...

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:20.570
Oh, it's stained and moth-eaten.

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:25.190
I suppose 100-year-old clothes are 
bound to be damaged in some way.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:29.050
I thought you could wear 
my father's suit, but...

00:08:29.050 --> 00:08:32.510
It's okay. The clothes don't matter.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:38.580
But I was excited to get dressed 
up and attend the party together.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:42.920
Hey, wait. That might work.

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:44.730
It's done.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:50.710
<b>Dress Cleaner</b>

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.780
<i>Dress Cleaner.</i>

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:50.710
<i>Beautifully restores any fabric, 
no matter how badly damaged.</i>

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:53.540
This will restore my dress?

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:56.560
Yeah. It'll be as good as 
new, down to the fibers.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:59.770
Wow! Now we'll be able to dress up!

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:00.680
Yeah.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:08.520
Lord Ejil ran off again today 
while I wasn't looking.

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:11.200
Where did he go?

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:12.830
Woof!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.300
Wh-What was that?

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.750
Are you looking for this guy?

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.580
Huh? Yes, I am.

00:09:19.580 --> 00:09:21.150
I know him.

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:22.720
What? You know Lord Ejil?

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:23.670
Yes!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.250
<b>Kirio Drugstore</b>

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.250
Woof!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.210
Mission complete.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:32.800
Welcome back, Ms. Noela.

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:36.520
Woof. You look cute.

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:38.800
Mr. Reiji is getting ready right now.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.140
Master, too?

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:43.520
Mr. Reiji, how's the size?

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:46.020
I'm about to put it—

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:46.840
Huh?!

00:09:46.840 --> 00:09:49.830
I'm sorry! I didn't know you 
were in the middle of changing!

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.060
Uh, okay...

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:54.720
I accidentally became a lucky peeping tom!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.780
I'm a lucky peeping tom, too!

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.740
What? Lucky?

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:02.130
Let me see how you look once 
you've put on the suit.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.200
Uh, sure.

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:09.510
<i>It's a perfect fit.</i>

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:13.960
<i>Mina's dad must have been exactly my height.</i>

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:19.530
<i>But for some reason, it's oddly difficult to 
breathe with this necktie around my neck.</i>

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.630
<i>Maybe it's because it 
reminds me of back then.</i>

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:36.140
<i>Back then, I'd wish for night to 
come soon from the moment I woke up.</i>

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.110
<i>But now...</i>

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:44.930
Mr. Reiji, that suit looks great on you.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:47.200
Woof. Master looks great.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:51.770
<i>Now I'm excited to see 
what will happen that day.</i>

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:55.990
But are you sure it's okay for me 
to wear your dad's clothes?

00:10:55.990 --> 00:10:58.790
Yes, I'm sure my father is delighted.

00:10:58.790 --> 00:11:00.130
Excuse me...

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:03.220
Why was I asleep?

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:05.770
Oh, Master! You're wearing a suit?

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.970
Yeah, what do you think? Does it look good?

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.560
Of course. You always look great, Master.

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:12.450
Someone's here.

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:13.690
Is it a customer?

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.610
Hey, Rei.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:19.450
Paula, it's already past lunchtime.

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:24.620
Could you not assume I only 
come here to eat lunch?

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:25.950
Then why did you come here?

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:31.250
This guy said he's looking 
for your part-timer.

00:11:31.490 --> 00:11:37.950
I serve the almighty ruler of 
the underworld, Lord Garo Ejil.

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:38.760
My name is Bel—

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:38.760
Belial!

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.020
Belial, what are you doing here?

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:49.420
Mina gave me some rice balls.

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:51.130
I see.

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:55.490
I had no idea you were working 
here part-time four days a week.

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:56.180
Here you are.

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:57.020
Thank you.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.870
Hey, Ejil. You should've told 
your guardian about that.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.890
Belial isn't my guardian.

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:04.720
I'm firing you if can't follow my rules.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:07.030
What?! V-Very well!

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.330
I'll be careful in the future, Master!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:10.470
You'd better be.

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:12.040
I promise!

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.040
Mr. Reiji.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:12.750
Yes?

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.080
You're not only famous for 
being a legendary pharmacist,

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:21.770
but you're also a great man to 
command the Demon King's obedience.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.090
Huh? Actually, I...

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:26.850
You are a Great Demon King who outstrips 
even the Demon King himself!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:28.260
Great Demon King!

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:31.980
First I was a medicine god, 
and now I'm a Great Demon King?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:35.000
Personal space, personal space...

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:37.230
I can trust Lord Ejil to you 
knowing you're a Great Demon King.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:40.500
I hope you'll continue to look after him.

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:41.940
Farewell.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:43.400
See you later.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:45.590
It's just four times a week.

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.720
A lot happened again today.

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:04.080
<i>This is the world I used to live in.</i>

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:09.720
<i>I don't want to go into the office.
 I wish I could skip work.</i>

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:14.740
<i>Someone free me from full trains, 
superiors who abuse their authority,</i>

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:16.890
<i>and the sales work I hate so much.</i>

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.090
<i>I hate it.</i>

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:23.570
<i>I hate this life!</i>

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:33.040
Huh?

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:39.920
Where am I?

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:46.790
What's going on?

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.260
I've never seen any of these plants before.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.270
<b>Kuchiari Fruit</b>

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.060
Huh? What's that?

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.940
<b>Mamasuki Grass</b>

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.610
<b>Yamaichigo</b>

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:02.600
Could it be that I'm...

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:06.710
<b>Kirio Reiji (24)
 From Another World</b>

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.450
I can see it. Wait, I'm from another world?

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:10.240
<b>Skills: Identification and 
Medicine Making</b>

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:10.030
My skills are Identification 
and Medicine Making?

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.980
Medicine Making? Is that like a pharmacist?

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:17.790
Was that an animal?

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:28.430
Hey, are you okay?

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:33.350
<b>Potion</b>

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:33.350
<i>Potion. Stops bleeding. 
Effective on external injuries.</i>

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:38.790
Potion? As in the item that 
recovers HP in role-playing games?

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:39.840
This will work.

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:43.480
Huh?

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:46.450
Isn't this yours? You don't like it?

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:51.170
It stinks! I wasn't expecting 
that. You can't drink this.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:53.790
But I have to do something.

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:57.440
Oh, right. My Medicine Making skill.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:58.400
Hold on.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.060
Okay, that should do it.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:17.970
It doesn't stink.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:22.630
How do you feel?

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.580
Ouch...

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:34.240
Huh?

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:37.500
Woof?

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:43.980
<b>Werewolf
 Demihuman Species With 
Human and Wolf Forms</b>

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.080
What? A werewolf?

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:43.570
"A demihuman species with 
human and wolf forms."

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.090
Woof. Noela.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.960
<b>Noela</b>

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.250
I see...

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:47.960
Woof.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:53.110
Thank you. I thought I was going to die.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:55.540
You're welcome.

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.430
That was very tasty.

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.520
It's the potion I made.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.810
It's delicious! Delicious!

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.000
I'm glad to hear that.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:05.770
Looks like your injuries have healed.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.930
I'm going to go find a town.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:09.200
I'll go with you.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:09.610
Huh?

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:11.440
I'll go with you, Master.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:14.210
Master? You mean me?

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.790
Woof. Master saved me.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:20.070
Let me thank you. I'll protect you.

00:16:20.070 --> 00:16:20.700
Huh?

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:25.540
I see. In that case, I'm counting on you.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.000
Woof!

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.630
Master, this way!

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:37.010
<i>I'm sure my new life will begin 
once we're out of these woods.</i>

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:42.440
Mr. Reiji, wake up.

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:45.370
Our escort to the party 
will be arriving soon.

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:50.070
Master, hurry.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.570
You two look great.

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:53.240
Woof.

00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:55.450
Well, shall we go to this party?

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:56.910
Yes.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.620
Thank you for waiting! 
Let us head to the party toge—

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:07.040
Huh? I thought I'd head 
there with everyone...

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.500
What?!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:17.430
Wow!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:19.860
So this is a party.

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:21.390
I'm impressed.

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:22.350
Woof.

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:25.530
It looks like something I've 
seen in a world history book.

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.160
You need to use utensils.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:31.780
Woof. Got it.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:35.280
Good.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.490
Mr. Reiji, you came.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:40.400
Yeah.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:44.410
Ms. Noela and Ms. Mina, 
thank you for coming, as well.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.660
I'm delighted you invited me.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:48.400
Woof.

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:50.200
Um...

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:54.200
Mr. Reiji, I've never seen 
you in a suit before.

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:55.050
I guess not.

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:58.510
Um, you look very... very...

00:17:58.980 --> 00:18:00.560
You look wonderful.

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:02.100
Oh, thanks.

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:06.200
Ah, alchemist. You came.

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:08.550
It's good to see you again, my lord.

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:10.770
Please enjoy the festivities.

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:14.870
There are a lot of ladies 
here hoping to meet you.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:16.030
What? Me?

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:17.670
Look, it's Mr. Kirio.

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:20.380
That's him?

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:24.910
Yes, that's Mr. Kirio, the genius 
alchemist who invented the beauty gel.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.970
He's so young and handsome.

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:29.040
What an attractive man.

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:31.490
Huh? Uh...

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:34.050
Mr. Kirio!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:36.700
Mr. Kirio, I'm the second 
daughter of the Estani family!

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:38.380
I'm the daughter of a lord!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:41.410
Hey, I'm speaking to Mr. Kirio right now!

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:43.350
Oh, I beg your pardon.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.290
How dare you get the jump on us?!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:46.310
Uh, um...

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.590
I'm going to say hello to him, too!

00:18:46.590 --> 00:18:51.120
Mr. Reiji, please be considerate 
to the other guests.

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:53.620
Should I protect Master?

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:54.950
No need.

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:57.880
How dare they ignore me to talk to him?!

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.070
Zeral, where are you?!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.740
You and I should go together some—

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:03.490
Hey!

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:06.600
I was wondering why you came 
alone even though the invitation

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:06.600
Feris, what are you doing here?

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:08.860
was addressed to both of us.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:08.860
Uh, wait...

00:19:08.860 --> 00:19:11.080
So this was your plan! 
You won't get away with this!

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:16.630
Those two never change.

00:19:21.290 --> 00:19:22.950
Rena, another drink.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:26.960
Coming right up. But Mr. Doz, 
I thought you were a lightweight.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:32.750
Today I've taken a medicine from the 
medicine god that increases my tolerance.

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:33.840
He sure has!

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:34.610
Oh...

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:37.110
In that case, have plenty to eat and drink.

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:39.780
The Rabbit Tavern is catering this event.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:40.710
Sure thing!

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:41.670
Sure thing!

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:42.700
Hey, Doz.

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:48.160
What's gotten into you today? 
You're drinkin' a lot.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:51.790
Doz is a bit different today.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.360
Ms. Rena, another drink.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:54.130
You got it.

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.130
Keep 'em comin'.

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:57.590
Sure thing.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:00.510
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:06.990
Now that the party is in full swing, 
let's heat things up even more!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:08.930
Yeah!

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:14.980
Let's all dance together!

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.310
Mr. Kururu!

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:17.770
Mr. Kururu?

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.910
<i>What? Did he just wink at me?</i>

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:27.450
Let's party!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.160
Go, go!

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:29.550
You look great, Brother!

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:30.370
Yeah!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:33.080
<i>Things are getting pretty crazy...</i>

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:39.740
I can't believe they wouldn't let me 
in just because I'm a little late.

00:20:39.740 --> 00:20:41.640
Who do they think I am?

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.150
Right, Ms. Noela?

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:45.480
"That's right. I love you, Mr. Ejil."

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.550
Oh, Ms. Noela!

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:50.520
Poor Lord Ejil!

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.640
Come, let us hold our own dance party!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.480
Why?!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.020
Mr. Reiji, let's dance.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.770
I want to dance with Master.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:00.650
Hey, wait!

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.450
I can't dance...

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:04.610
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:08.660
<i>As long as I get to see 
them enjoying themselves.</i>

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:16.250
<i>Besides, this world gave me a 
chance to enjoy a different life,</i>

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:19.710
<i>as well as kindness.</i>

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:24.880
<b>Closing Time</b>

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:26.340
Kirio Drugstore.

00:21:26.340 --> 00:21:27.510
Thank you...

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.470
...for visiting...

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.430
...again today!

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:07.490
Master is making another medicine.

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:09.400
Well, this is a drugstore.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:12.360
What are you making this time?

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:13.880
Who knows?

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:25.020
It's done!

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:33.950
<b>Today's Prescription: 
Let's Open a Drugstore in Another World!</b>

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:27.700
Yeah!

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:27.700
Good work!

00:23:27.700 --> 00:23:29.660
Thank you, everyone!

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:34.300
The slow life rocks!

00:23:33.060 --> 00:23:34.970
See you later!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Illustration by: Zounose</b>
